        <mxCell id="cd-note11" value="&lt;b&gt;How dev was actually deployed:&lt;/b&gt; from a workstation with scripts/deploy-ecs.sh (same buildx multi-arch build, push to ECR, ECS update, wait for steady state) and scripts/rollback-ecs.sh — every Terraform apply was approved by a human. GitHub OIDC needs github_repository set; note that an org SCP currently denies iam:ListOpenIDConnectProviders, so confirm OIDC is permitted before relying on it." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5DBDB;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
